cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "ThermalBench: An Open, Progressive Benchmark for Generalizable 2.5D/3D-IC Thermal Learning"
abstract: >-
  An operator-learning benchmark for 2.5D/3D-IC thermal simulation under a single
  shared data split and a single shared metric implementation. It covers 8 models
  across 4 datasets of increasing difficulty, the last of which is a pure
  extrapolation set built from unseen cases, and supports training, evaluation and
  few-shot fine-tuning from one entry point.
authors:
